{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/52f48d723e2af4c77a08bf66eacd021c.poster.avif?t=1754619223\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/52f48d723e2af4c77a08bf66eacd021c.webm?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/52f48d723e2af4c77a08bf66eacd021c.mp4?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Internship</i>, you are one of many unpaid interns trapped aboard a failing corporate spaceship, tasked with <strong>building, repairing, and surviving in deep space</strong>. Stranded after a catastrophic mission gone wrong, your only hope is to <strong>venture into dangerous cave biomes</strong>, gather resources, and expand the ship\u2014while juggling absurd corporate demands. As the station grows, so do the <strong>challenges, unexpected hazards, and ridiculous intergalactic office politics</strong>. With an overbearing AI supervisor, bizarre alien encounters, and a never-ending to-do list, you must <strong>prove your worth, climb the corporate ladder, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014escape this never-ending internship.</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tiny Interns\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>tiny interns</strong> may be small, but they are the backbone of the spaceship colony\u2014<strong>underpaid, overworked, and hilariously unqualified</strong> for the chaos they face. Assigned to every task imaginable, from <strong>building and repairing to resource gathering and survival</strong>, these wide-eyed recruits navigate disasters with <strong>determination and sheer luck</strong>. Whether swinging through zero gravity, barely dodging collapsing caves, or getting tangled in their own ropes, they persist\u2014because quitting isn\u2019t an option in space. As the colony expands, so do their roles, unlocking <strong>new skills, equipment, and increasingly absurd corporate demands</strong>. They may be interns, but they\u2019re humanity\u2019s last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/fd86643a1ad8f951ba570821bce6e62c.poster.avif?t=1754619223\" width=678 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/fd86643a1ad8f951ba570821bce6e62c.webm?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/fd86643a1ad8f951ba570821bce6e62c.mp4?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fans +\u00a0Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for supporting our efforts to build this game. Without you, the project would have died long ago. Your fan art, animations and sculptures motivated us to keep going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/ebad66af12938b1c233462964a795d58.avif?t=1754619223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras_big/ebad66af12938b1c233462964a795d58.avif?t=1754619223 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For more LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the game &quot;No Humanity - The Hardest Game&quot; on your phone to get a taste of what we are cooking :0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1867920?t=1754619223","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1867920?t=1754619223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/e17931a449de567e2c3effdc0dad5acd0bb1274d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754619223","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/e17931a449de567e2c3effdc0dad5acd0bb1274d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754619223","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/52f48d723e2af4c77a08bf66eacd021c.poster.avif?t=1754619223\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/52f48d723e2af4c77a08bf66eacd021c.webm?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/52f48d723e2af4c77a08bf66eacd021c.mp4?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Internship</i>, you are one of many unpaid interns trapped aboard a failing corporate spaceship, tasked with <strong>building, repairing, and surviving in deep space</strong>. Stranded after a catastrophic mission gone wrong, your only hope is to <strong>venture into dangerous cave biomes</strong>, gather resources, and expand the ship\u2014while juggling absurd corporate demands. As the station grows, so do the <strong>challenges, unexpected hazards, and ridiculous intergalactic office politics</strong>. With an overbearing AI supervisor, bizarre alien encounters, and a never-ending to-do list, you must <strong>prove your worth, climb the corporate ladder, and maybe\u2014just maybe\u2014escape this never-ending internship.</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tiny Interns\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>tiny interns</strong> may be small, but they are the backbone of the spaceship colony\u2014<strong>underpaid, overworked, and hilariously unqualified</strong> for the chaos they face. Assigned to every task imaginable, from <strong>building and repairing to resource gathering and survival</strong>, these wide-eyed recruits navigate disasters with <strong>determination and sheer luck</strong>. Whether swinging through zero gravity, barely dodging collapsing caves, or getting tangled in their own ropes, they persist\u2014because quitting isn\u2019t an option in space. As the colony expands, so do their roles, unlocking <strong>new skills, equipment, and increasingly absurd corporate demands</strong>. They may be interns, but they\u2019re humanity\u2019s last hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/fd86643a1ad8f951ba570821bce6e62c.poster.avif?t=1754619223\" width=678 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/fd86643a1ad8f951ba570821bce6e62c.webm?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/fd86643a1ad8f951ba570821bce6e62c.mp4?t=1754619223\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fans +\u00a0Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for supporting our efforts to build this game. Without you, the project would have died long ago. Your fan art, animations and sculptures motivated us to keep going!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras/ebad66af12938b1c233462964a795d58.avif?t=1754619223\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/extras_big/ebad66af12938b1c233462964a795d58.avif?t=1754619223 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For more LORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the game &quot;No Humanity - The Hardest Game&quot; on your phone to get a taste of what we are cooking :0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["SweatyChair"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867920/6a1d81a6597824d91c4c194713931433fc201583/header.jpg?t=1754619223","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.5 Ghz CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1867920/460297/d1297bdbb6a4462fca21ccaf6590b1290414b608/1751041656/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753948625","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1867920/460297/d1297bdbb6a4462fca21ccaf6590b1290414b608/1751041656/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753948625","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail